{
  "area": "boundary",
  "description": "AGSC-11-24: a typed peer that cannot be applied is refused with the code of its fault. Derivation, case by case: (1) a translation-layer peer with no crosswalk lacks a required member, AGSC-E202; (2) a relationship friend is outside the enumeration, AGSC-E203; (3) a crosswalk that holds a statement with skos:relatedMatch, which is not one of the four predicates, is a statement of another shape, AGSC-E209; (4) a crosswalk path that names no file of the Bundle is AGSC-E901. Each refusal is a fault of the node's own configuration, found before any peer is fetched.",
  "expected": {
    "cases": [
      {
        "error": "AGSC-E202",
        "name": "translation-layer-without-crosswalk"
      },
      {
        "error": "AGSC-E203",
        "name": "unknown-relationship"
      },
      {
        "error": "AGSC-E209",
        "name": "statement-of-another-shape"
      },
      {
        "error": "AGSC-E901",
        "name": "crosswalk-file-absent"
      }
    ]
  },
  "id": "bnd-0048",
